PCL-CE (Plain Craft Launcher Community Edition)
https://github.com/PCL-Community/PCL-CE

  For interoperability with PCL-CE, parts of src/main/core/pcl/ follow the
  configuration format, storage locations and encryption format defined in the
  PCL.Core project of PCL-CE, which is licensed under the Apache License 2.0:
    - PCL.Core/App/Configuration (config file locations, keys and value formats)
    - PCL.Core/Utils/Secret/EncryptHelper.cs and PCL.Core/Utils/Encryption
      (encrypted value format)
    - PCL.Core/Minecraft/Java/UserPreference (Java preference format)
    - PCL.Core/App/Config.cs (default JVM arguments)

  Some launch behaviors (version isolation policy, memory slider scale,
  game folder discovery) are independently reimplemented to stay compatible
  with PCL-CE. No source code from the "Plain Craft Launcher 2" directory of
  PCL-CE is included in this product.

  PixelsWorld Launcher is not affiliated with or endorsed by the PCL or
  PCL-CE projects.

PlainToolkit.CngProtectedData
https://github.com/PCL-Community/PlainToolkit.CngProtectedData

